---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import YouTubePlaylistGrid from '../components/YouTubePlaylistGrid.astro';
import '../styles/index.css';
import '../styles/videos.css';
---

<Layout
	title="KingTech | Videos"
	description="Watch videos from KingTech."
>
	<div class="page-shell">
		<main>
			<section class="intro-block video-intro-card intro-accent-card">
				<div class="video-intro-content">
					<p>
						At KingTech, we want to inspire people to experiment and discover new technology for
						themselves. That is why we film our most interesting projects. On our
						<a href="https://www.youtube.com/@kingtech7146">YouTube channel</a>, you will find our
						latest builds, experiments, and tech reviews.
					</p>

					<p>
						<b>Crafty Creations:</b><br>
						From Arduino-powered LED displays to Raspberry Pi home automation, we'll explore projects
						that blend code, circuits, and imagination. Whether you're a seasoned maker or a curious
						newbie, there's a project here with your name on it.
					</p>

					<p>
						<b>Build Guides Galore:</b><br>
						From budget-friendly gaming PCs to high-end workstations, we walk through every step of
						the assembly process.
					</p>

					<p>
						<b>Server Shenanigans:</b><br>
						Servers are not just for data centers. They are perfect for home labs too. We explore how
						to set up a home server for media streaming, file storage, or even hosting your own website.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="video-intro-image">
					<img src="/videocreation.png" alt="KingTech video creation projects" />
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="intro-block video-topic-card">
				<div>
					<h2>PC builds</h2>
					<p>
						On the KingTech YouTube channel, you will find multiple PC and server builds. Building
						technology has always been at the core of KingTech, and computers are no exception. In our
						PC build videos, we show how we build the systems in our office and our server setup. From
						time to time, people ask us to build a custom PC. Whenever we take on one of those projects,
						we try to film it and add it to the PC build playlist.
					</p>

					<YouTubePlaylistGrid
						playlistId="PLCTxFN9iaBYUgMO5MhWv8i0ZprEYSDBBK"
						limit={3}
						fallbackText="Latest playlist videos are temporarily unavailable."
					/>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="intro-block video-topic-card">
				<div>
					<h2>Reviews</h2>
					<p>
						KingTech exists to create and explore new technology, and we are genuine gadget enthusiasts.
						That is why we also build and review electronics on our YouTube channel. If this is your
						kind of content, subscribe to stay up to date and not miss any new videos.
					</p>

					<YouTubePlaylistGrid
						playlistId="PLCTxFN9iaBYVAvyhnvoMlzZgcKVZwfZKf"
						limit={3}
						fallbackText="Latest playlist videos are temporarily unavailable."
					/>
				</div>
			</section>
		</main>
	</div>
</Layout>
